WEBVTT

00:01:59.316 --> 00:02:02.356
Now, my story is anecdotal.

00:02:03.796 --> 00:02:06.916
But the fact that the vast majority
of scientific research

00:02:06.916 --> 00:02:09.116
is only available in English

00:02:09.156 --> 00:02:11.876
is a big problem when it comes
to climate change ...

00:02:13.076 --> 00:02:18.436
(Applause)

00:02:18.476 --> 00:02:22.476
because most people in the world
don't speak English.

00:02:23.156 --> 00:02:27.716
In fact, 75 percent of them
do not speak English at all.

00:02:28.996 --> 00:02:33.116
